<<declare $srosha_talk = 0>>
<<if $doorlock is true>>
Srosha: Doth not taking the door to ye liking!
Marji: I think its locked...
Srosha: mmmmm, How wouldst thy solve such a conundrum?
Marji: Theres a bat in the gym closet, I could run over there and break the door open!
Srosha: Tis thee prepared to face thine wrath of her superiors for such a reckless act?
Marji: No... Ugh! I dunno! I give up! You have a better idea?
Srosha: Perhap one must look unto thyself, and see thine burdens from which thy carry.
Marji: What?
Srosha: Check your pockets.
<<if $srosha_talk is 0>>
<<SetTask GameStateMachine 0 1>>
<<set $srosha_talk to 1>>
<<endif>>
<<else>>
Srosha: Good luck.
<<endif>>
